  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supply of Medical Equipment for the Rehabilitation and Correctio Centers in Nablus and Jenin.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Equipment for two correction and rehabilitation centers in Jenin and Nablus. The equipment will be used at the health clinics for the emergency room, doctor&apos;s room, nursing room, dental clinic and testing laboratories. A detailed list of equipment is provided within Annex II of this contract and includes 232 items.The place of acceptance of the supplies shall be the correction and rehabilitation centers in Jenin and Nablus, the time limits for delivery shall 120 Calendar Days and the Incoterm applicable shall be DDP . The implementation period of tasks shall run from the late date of contract signature by all parties to the date of provisional acceptance</narrative>
  </description>
